cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RadioPile: a preprocessing pipeline for RF IQ datasets"
abstract: >
  A modular preprocessing pipeline for RF IQ datasets, producing unified
  ML-ready HDF5 files with rich per-window metadata. Covers technology
  recognition, modulation classification, and radar waveform recognition
  across real-world and simulated datasets.
authors:
